  "Each pair is its own deck, with its own cards and its own schedule. Opening another one never touches the first. The switch says whether today’s prompts are captured into that language; every language left on fills its own queue, and they never wait on each other.": "每个语言对都是独立的卡组，有自己的卡片和自己的进度。打开另一个不会影响前一个。开关决定今天的提示词是否捕获到该语言；每个开着的语言各自填充自己的队列，互不等待。",
  "Easing off the new words for now": "暂时放缓新词",
