  "Estimated {band} from {n} answers · set a floor to override": "根据 {n} 次作答估算为 {band} · 设定下限可覆盖",
  "Every card is filed under one category, and the ones you pick here are the only ones the builder may use. Pick a field to set them all at once, or choose by hand. Three are always on: set phrases, connectors and everyday words. Drop a category and the cards it held move to Everyday — file them again to place them properly. Filing again also gives every card a topic — code review, airport, standup — which the Deck shows as chapters.": "每张卡片只归入一个分类，生成器只能使用你在这里选中的分类。选择一个领域即可一次设定全部，也可以手动勾选。三个分类始终开启：固定表达、连接词和日常词汇。移除某个分类后，它的卡片会转到「日常」——重新归类即可把它们放回合适的位置。 重新归档还会给每张卡片一个主题——代码评审、机场、站会——卡组会把它们显示为章节。",
  "Every meaning has exactly one card.": "每个意思都只有一张卡片。",
  "Every model call the trainer makes is logged with its tokens, from the result Claude Code reports. The builder runs as a bare completion — no tools, no project context — so a batch of twenty records costs the records and the brief, nothing else. Changing the model only changes the calls from now on; the line per model shows what each one has used.": "训练器的每次模型调用都会根据 Claude Code 报告的结果记录其 token。构建器以纯补全方式运行——没有工具，没有项目上下文——所以二十条记录的一批只花记录和简报的费用。切换模型只影响之后的调用；每个模型一行，显示它各自用了多少。",
  "Every number here comes from your own review log.": "这里的每个数字都来自你自己的复习记录。",
  "Every one of these costs a model call. Throw away what you already know — it never comes back.": "每一条都要花一次模型调用。把已经会的丢掉——它不会再回来。",
  "Every prompt starts a wait. Loanword prints one card into the session while it lasts. Nothing is graded; it is a glance, not a test.": "每个提示词都要等待。等待期间 Loanword 会在会话里显示一张卡片。不评分——只是看一眼，不是测试。",
